        english: "You have an excellent model in Abraham and those who were with him, when he said to his people: \"We are through with you, and those you worship other than God. We reject you. Enmity and hate have come between you and us for ever, unless you believe in God the One,\" -- except for what he said to his father: \"I shall ask forgiveness for you, but I have no power to prevail with God for you.\" \"O Lord, we place our trust in You, and turn to You in penitence, and to You is our returning.",
